Q1 — Check contents on button click
The journal's first question uses a button click and document.write("Hello Romal").     BDNS Journal
Step 1 — Create q1.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Basic jQuery</title>

    <script src="jquery-3.6.1.min.js"></script>

