Q2 — Select elements by class, ID and element name
The journal demonstrates:
- .class1 → class selector
- #id1 → ID selector
- h2 → element selector.     BDNS Journal
Create q2.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Basic jQuery</title>

    <script src="jquery-3.6.1.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        $(document).ready(function () {

            $(".class1").css("background", "lightblue");

