Q6 — Fade In and Fade Out
The journal uses fadeOut(5000) and fadeIn(5000).     BDNS Journal
Create q6.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>

    <title>Basic jQuery</title>

    <script src="jquery-3.6.1.min.js"></script>

    <script>

        $(document).ready(function () {

            $(".c1").click(function () {
                $("p").fadeOut(5000);
            });

            $(".c2").click(function () {
                $("p").fadeIn(5000);
            });

        });

    </script>

</head>

<body>

    <p>Romal Shah:239720</p>

    <button class="c1">Fade Out</button>

    <button class="c2">Fade In</button>

</body>
</html>

Output
Romal Shah:239720

[Fade Out] [Fade In]

Click Fade Out → paragraph gradually disappears.
Click Fade In → paragraph gradually appears.
5000 means approximately 5 seconds.
